OL,3,CThailand shooting: At least six people
OL,4,Cdead at school near Bangkok
OL,6,FAt least six people including three
OL,7,Fstudents have been killed after a
OL,8,Fstudent opened fire at a secondary
OL,9,Fschool in Thailand on Friday morning.
OL,11,FThree teachers were killed in the
OL,12,Fattack at Debsirin Nonthaburi School,
OL,13,Fon the northern outskirts of Bangkok,
OL,14,Fwhile more than a dozen others were
OL,15,Fwounded, a police spokesperson said.
OL,17,FWhile early reports had quoted police
OL,18,Fsaying the suspected gunman had died,
OL,19,Fpolice have confirmed he remains in
OL,20,Fcritical condition and doctors are
OL,21,Fproviding emergency treatment.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/6
