OL,3,CThailand shooting: At least six people
OL,4,Cdead at school near Bangkok
OL,6,FAt least 15 people are wounded, with
OL,7,Ftwo in a critical condition, following
OL,8,Fthe school of about 3,000 students,
OL,9,Flocated on a busy highway in the Bang
OL,10,FKruai district of Nonthaburi province.
OL,12,FA photo provided to ITV News' North
OL,13,FAmerican partner CNN by a police
OL,14,Fofficial in Bangkok shows a single
OL,15,Fhandgun and multiple rounds of
OL,16,Fammunition scattered on the floor
OL,17,Finside the school.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
