OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786126702
OL,3,CThailand shooting: At least six people
OL,4,Cdead at school near Bangkok
OL,6,FThe firearm is believed to have
OL,7,Fbelonged to a family member of the
OL,8,Fsuspected gunman, but police have not
OL,9,Fyet determined how he gained access to
OL,10,Fthe weapon, police said, adding that
OL,11,Fhe had been living with adult
OL,12,Frelatives rather than with his parents.
OL,14,FThailand's Central Investigation
OL,15,FBureau told ITV News' North American
OL,16,Fpartner CNN that the "situation is now
OL,17,Funder control".
