OL,3,CThailand shooting: At least six people
OL,4,Cdead at school near Bangkok
OL,6,FVideo verified by CNN appears to show
OL,7,Fstudents running out of the school, as
OL,8,Fa staff member helps to evacuate them,
OL,9,Fwhile emergency workers rushed to the
OL,10,Fscene with stretchers.
OL,12,FGun ownership in Thailand is
OL,13,Frelatively high compared with other
OL,14,Fcountries in Southeast Asia.
OL,16,FThere were more than 10.3 million
OL,17,Fcivilian owned firearms in Thailand,
OL,18,For around 15 guns for every 100
OL,19,Fpeople, according to 2017 data from
OL,20,Fthe Switzerland-based Small Arms
OL,21,FSurvey (SAS).
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/6
