OL,3,CThailand shooting: At least six people
OL,4,Cdead at school near Bangkok
OL,6,FThailand ranks as the Southeast Asian
OL,7,Fcountry with the second-highest gun
OL,8,Fhomicides after the Philippines,
OL,9,Faccording to the Institute for Health
OL,10,FMetrics and Evaluation (IHME) at the
OL,11,FUniversity of Washington's 2019 Global
OL,12,FBurden of Disease database.
OL,14,FIn February, a teacher died and a
OL,15,Fstudent was wounded in southern
OL,16,FThailand's Hat Yai district after a
OL,17,Fgunman opened fire at a school.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/6
