OL,3,CThailand shooting: At least six people
OL,4,Cdead at school near Bangkok
OL,6,FIn 2022, 36 people were killed, 24 of
OL,7,Fthem children, in a massacre at a
OL,8,Fchild care center in the northeast,
OL,9,Fbelieved to be the country's deadliest
OL,10,Fincident of its kind.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/6
